## Optional — phone pairing over a public HTTPS tunnel (ngrok, Cloudflare, etc.)
## 1) Copy this file to `.env.local` in this folder (same folder as package.json).
## 2) Paste the https URL from `ngrok http 5173` (no trailing slash).
## 3) Restart `npm run dev` so Vite picks up the variable.
##    (Often optional while ngrok runs: dev can auto-read the HTTPS URL from the ngrok agent on localhost:4040.)
#
# VITE_PAIRING_ORIGIN=https://YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.ngrok-free.app
#
# If Vite logs "Blocked request" for your tunnel host, add it (comma-separated, use a leading dot for all subdomains):
# __VITE_ADDITIONAL_SERVER_ALLOWED_HOSTS=.example.com
